---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About the creator of inteligenciaartificialdev.com and PromptVault.">
  <section class="container about">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        This site started from a practical problem: writing the same kind of
        prompt over and over while building software, and losing time
        reformulating something that should have already been ready to go.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm a computer science instructor and systems analyst, and I build
        educational tools and AI products — from question generators for
        public exams to AI-assisted essay grading platforms. PromptVault
        came from that same instinct: turn a manual, repetitive process into
        something tested, documented, and reusable.
      </p>
      <p>
        On this blog I write about what I actually use: applied prompt
        engineering, honest comparisons between AI tools for development,
        and workflows that save real time — no hype, just what works.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-block: 56px 80px;
    max-width: 68ch;
  }

  .about h1 {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
</style>
